PART 2: WHAT IS REACT?

================================================================================

React Definition

React, also called ReactJS, is an open-source JavaScript library for building user interfaces.

Characteristic        | Description
----------------------|----------------------------------------------
Type                  | JavaScript library
Main Purpose          | Building user interfaces
Original Creator      | Facebook
Public Release        | 2013
Development Model     | Open source
Architecture          | Component-based
Programming Style     | Declarative

React's Purpose

React helps developers:

Build small and large user interfaces.
Build interactive web applications.
Represent changing application data using state.
Update the UI without requiring a full page reload for each state change.
Create reusable UI components.
Organize complex user interfaces.

